<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria offers 10 bln levs 1-wk T-bills Wednesday.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria offers 10 bln levs 1-wk T-bills Wednesday.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's Finance Ministry will offer 10 billion levs of one-week discount T-bills at an auction on Wednesday, the Bulgarian National Bank said.</p>
<p>Details of the issue follow:</p>
<p> Issue number	 BG 3010997008</p>
<p> Auction date	 January 15, 1997</p>
<p> Issue date	   January 16, 1997</p>
<p> Maturity date	January 23, 1997</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 981 8569</p>
</text>
